iv class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: bold; height: 65.5209px;\">\n<tbody><!-- 表格模块 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 19.5833px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"B49Ld2XI1oXblrxJQMGcAme5nkf\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJQ5dFrBqoBKuuxJB7qconzpnoc\">Thread Direction<span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"B49Ld2XI1oXblrxJQMGcAme5nkf\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BElkdn8aEoCwJxxxX8xcmCAonMd\">CW Thred<span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 表格模块 按需增加--> <!-- 表格模块 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 22.9688px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 22.9688px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"B49Ld2XI1oXblrxJQMGcAme5nkf\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-QZQTdDOSDoxhqDxD53Rcn8DunUd\">Thread Size</div>\n</div>\n<span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"B49Ld2XI1oXblrxJQMGcAme5nkf\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Thread Size\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0*1+b\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7386551383364861954\"],\"1\":[\"inlineCode\",\"true\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"pasteRandomId\":\"ae83b9b0-6011-4bc1-8633-eb49200621be\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":57,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":11},\"recordId\":\"QZQTdDOSDoxhqDxD53Rcn8DunUd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 22.9688px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">M3 Bottom Hole </span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 表格模块 按需增加--> <!-- 表格模块 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 22.9688px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center; height: 22.9688px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Qty</span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 22.9688px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">12 PCS</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 表格模块 按需增加--></tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Torque limit</strong>: Do not overtighten the M3 screws when installing the ball joint to prevent stripping the aluminum threads.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This Aluminum Alloy Rod End Ball Joint is a premium-grade component designed for precision and durability. Made from high-strength aluminum alloy, it offers excellent wear resistance, corrosion protection, and lightweight performance. This ball joint is ideal for RC cars, robotics, and 3D printing projects, providing smooth and reliable pivot points for mechanical assemblies. Compatible with Carbon Steel Full-Thread Rod, it can be easily integrated into various designs, offering flexibility and convenience for makers and hobbyists.\n\nHigh-Quality Aluminum Alloy: Made from durable aluminum alloy, offering excellent corrosion resistance, wear protection, and a lightweight design.\n\nSmooth & Precise Movement: The ball joint ensures smooth articulation, making it ideal for RC car suspensions, steering systems, and other pivot-based mechanisms.\n\nFlexible & Practical Applications: Compatible with fully threaded rods, making assembly easy and secure. Ideal for RC car upgrades, robotics, and custom 3D-printed projects requiring reliable pivoting components.\n\nTorque limit: Do not overtighten the M3 screws when installing the ball joint to prevent stripping the aluminum threads.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
